==Description==
The '''Champion Nametag''' is a nametag given to users that are in the first, second or third place on the leaderboards in the main lobby. Players who top the leaderboards in the intermission lobbies, daily or monthly, do not get this tag. 

The '''Champion Nametag''' has orange text adorned with a white gleam that traverses the middle of each letter. Additionally, the nametag emits sparkling particles around it making it look like it is shining and has wind behind it. The nametag is accompanied with a translucent black outline and two trophies to the left and right of it. The original version of this nametag lacked the wind and trophies.

